# Optional secrets for hosted Edge Functions (set in the Supabase dashboard
# today, or Lovable Cloud → Secrets after cutover). Do not put real values in git.
# Cloud auto-injects SUPABASE_URL, SUPABASE_ANON_KEY, SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY
# and LOVABLE_API_KEY — do not try to overwrite those prefixes.

# If set to a random string of at least 16 characters, create-practitioner
# accepts JSON { "invite_token": "<same value>", "email", "password" }.
# If unset, only a signed-in Predictiv admin (is_blog_admin) may call it.
# Values are write-only in both dashboards; keep a copy in the password manager.
PRACTITIONER_INVITE_TOKEN=
